{"data":{"body":"[P2] Apply the preview cap before serializing a mask value\n\nParser constraints bound values read from JSON, but a configured `maskString` bypasses them. `writeValueAsBytes` materializes that entire candidate before comparing it with `maxPreviewBytes`, so a tiny preview budget can still cause an unbounded duplicate allocation and OOM. Measure with a capped output stream, or reject oversized masks using bounded UTF-8 measurement, and add a constrained-heap regression.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7okCIB","finding_digest":"5569849aaa6f231cfcab68b6fef126eb700831658d28e1c3d0a4d8d653c1b3aa","finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","finding_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","identity_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","line":430,"observation_digest":"aca2fbe5dc7fa2fcfdd64e4007cca606536e0c9aa7d24ec6b968d960464224cc","observation_id":"aro_v1_vsrpxzo4p6rpz7owjzaaptfgaz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:29:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_wbpcd537x2snttz7xawbvl5n6j","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"d3eaf0fc72800288b6d1abe617884f39baa4aa9d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":430,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_75cssi5zs5np5liiycuobaptpt","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:29:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
